{"title":"*The Almighty Dollar*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/945971246/0/marginalrevolution~The-Almighty-Dollar.html","date":1770839036000,"content":"<p>The author is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://history.princeton.edu/people/brendan-greeley\" target=\"_blank\">Brendan Greeley</a>, and the subtitle is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Almighty-Dollar-Years-Worlds-Powerful/dp/0593138880/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2EG0X27FAHAH0&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.fs59uL1RvY8mKjaD35j5poxrDIPyJtuHr12yzKFeDo2gkNN3K0RaBPtCMMmCT9Jge4sX0QeD5rvC2NR92uWFoMTG0vvGRavQt6-8b4zoi0llA4devquL_3SyofakNioIubmZQvRq_vpYtN_k3UiWBw.-ioKPw5Td0ijWPlcj8meAcn9Yqrlm2bz_n8d1iOGOoY&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=brendan+greeley&amp;qid=1770749120&amp;sprefix=brendan+greeley%2Caps%2C117&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">500 Years of the World’s Most Powerful Money</a>.  A very well-timed book, excellent on the history of the dollar as it spans the centuries, I was happy to write a blurb for it.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-almighty-dollar.html\">*The Almighty Dollar*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/945971246/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/945971246/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/945971246/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/945971246/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.